<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Modern Web Application</title>

    <style>
        body{
            margin:0;
            font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
            background:#f4f4f4;
        }

        header{
            background:#0077cc;
            color:white;
            padding:20px;
            text-align:center;
        }

        nav{
            background:#333;
            padding:12px;
            text-align:center;
        }

        nav a{
            color:white;
            text-decoration:none;
            margin:20px;
            font-weight:bold;
        }

        section{
            background:white;
            width:80%;
            margin:20px auto;
            padding:20px;
            border-radius:8px;
            box-shadow:0 0 8px gray;
        }

        h2{
            color:#0077cc;
        }

        input{
            width:100%;
            padding:10px;
            margin:8px 0;
        }

        input[type="submit"]{
            background:#0077cc;
            color:white;
            border:none;
            cursor:pointer;
        }

        pre{
            background:#eeeeee;
            padding:10px;
            border-left:5px solid blue;
        }

        footer{
            background:#0077cc;
            color:white;
            text-align:center;
            padding:15px;
            margin-top:20px;
        }
    </style>

</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Modern Web Application</h1>
    <p>HTML5 | XML | HTTP</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#video">Video</a>
    <a href="#register">Register</a>
    <a href="#xml">XML</a>
</nav>

<section id="home">
    <h2>Welcome</h2>
    <p>
        This webpage demonstrates standards-compliant web development using
        HTML5 semantic elements, HTTP communication, XML, and secure form
        submission.
    </p>
</section>

<section id="video">
    <h2>Promotional Video</h2>

    <video width="600" controls>
        <source src="video.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
    </video>

</section>

<section id="register">

    <h2>User Registration</h2>

    <form action="register.php" method="POST">

        <label>Name</label>
        <input type="text" name="name" required>

        <label>Email</label>
        <input type="email" name="email" required>

        <label>Password</label>
        <input type="password" name="password" required>

        <input type="submit" value="Register">

    </form>

</section>

<section id="xml">

    <h2>XML Configuration Example</h2>

<pre>
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<config>
    <website>Modern Web Application</website>
    <version>1.0</version>
</config>
</pre>

</section>

<section>

<h2>HTTP Communication Flow</h2>

<ol>
    <li>User enters website URL.</li>
    <li>DNS resolves the domain name.</li>
    <li>Browser sends an HTTP request.</li>
    <li>Server processes the request.</li>
    <li>HTTP response is returned.</li>
    <li>Browser renders the webpage.</li>
</ol>

</section>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Modern Web Application | Internet Programming</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
